      children: [(0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_components.strong, {
        children: "Osho Darshan:"
      }), " The bright path is a ladder of increasing light: fire, light, day, the bright half, the northern course. Osho reads each rung as a quality of awareness — the fire that burns the dross, the light that sees, the day that is awake, the waxing that grows, the northward that rises. The knowers of Brahman do not die into this path; they live along it. Their whole life is an ascent through brightness, and death simply finds them already on the stairs. The path of light is not a route at the end; it is a direction taken every morning."]
